#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:8
msgid "按失败阶段定位问题"
msgstr "Locate failures by stage"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:10
msgid "先保留完整命令、第一条错误和实际日志路径，再按失败阶段检查。修改作者输入后 重跑对应命令；生成文件和旧通过报告不用于修复输入。"
msgstr ""
"First retain the complete command, the first error and actual log paths, "
"then inspect the failing stage. After editing author inputs, rerun the "
"relevant command. Generated files and old success reports do not repair an "
"input."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "阶段与现象"
msgstr "Stage and symptom"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "检查与处理"
msgstr "Checks and action"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "成功判据"
msgstr "Success criterion"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "找不到 Nexus package"
msgstr "Nexus package not found"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "源码选 `<nexus>/cmake`，安装包选 `<prefix>/lib/cmake/Nexus`；核对 `Nexus_DIR`"
msgstr ""
"For source, select `<nexus>/cmake`; for an installed package, select "
"`<prefix>/lib/cmake/Nexus`. Check `Nexus_DIR`."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "同一工程找到所选来源"
msgstr "The project finds the selected source"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "工具链或 ABI 冲突"
msgstr "Toolchain or ABI conflict"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "工具链在 `project()` 前选定；换工具链、装配或 SDK 时使用新 builddir"
msgstr ""
"Select the toolchain before `project()`; use a new build directory when "
"changing the toolchain, assembly or SDK."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "实际编译器、CPU／FPU／ABI 与所选事实一致"
msgstr "The actual compiler, CPU/FPU and ABI match the selected facts"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "缺少锁定依赖"
msgstr "Missing pinned dependency"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "源码执行所选 preset／assembly 的 prepare；只有显式 `--allow-network` 允许获取"
msgstr ""
"For source, prepare the selected preset/assembly. Only explicit `--allow-"
"network` permits fetching."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "选中闭包的 pin、来源、许可和工作区检查通过"
msgstr ""
"Pins, provenance, licenses and worktrees pass checks for the selected "
"closure"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "Native 被拒绝"
msgstr "Native rejected"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "模型解析和创建明确加 `--test-support`，CMake 明确 `NEXUS_TEST_SUPPORT=ON`"
msgstr ""
"Explicitly use `--test-support` for model resolution and creation, and "
"`NEXUS_TEST_SUPPORT=ON` for CMake."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "模型仅在该测试支撑范围启用"
msgstr "The model is enabled only within the explicit test-support scope"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "TOML 未知字段或 binding"
msgstr "Unknown TOML field or binding"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "用同一平台的 schema、`list-bindings` 和当前 Board 查询；修正作者字段"
msgstr ""
"Use the schema and `list-bindings` from the same platform with the current "
"Board; correct author fields."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "`check` 接受完整装配"
msgstr "`check` accepts the complete assembly"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "pin／DMA／IRQ／时钟冲突"
msgstr "Pin/DMA/IRQ/clock conflict"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "根据诊断的资源和两个 owner 调整真实配置，不静默换路线"
msgstr ""
"Adjust the actual configuration using the diagnosed resource and both "
"owners; do not silently change routes."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "`explain` 展示预期资源及容量"
msgstr "`explain` reports the expected resources and capacities"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "SDK identity／epoch 不匹配"
msgstr "SDK identity/epoch mismatch"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "核对 SDK 完整提交、manifest、接口代际和应用锁；重新取得正确包"
msgstr ""
"Check the full SDK commit, manifest, interface epoch and application lock; "
"obtain the correct package again."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "完整性校验及期望提交接纳"
msgstr "Integrity verification and expected revision are accepted"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "构建目录 busy"
msgstr "Build directory busy"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "等待该目录的真实持有者结束，或选择独立目录；不删除运行中的锁文件"
msgstr ""
"Wait for its actual owner to finish or choose a separate directory. Do not "
"delete an active lock file."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "一个构建目录只有一个写入者"
msgstr "Each build directory has one writer"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "请求超时或 stop BUSY"
msgstr "Request timeout or stop BUSY"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "保持被借用存储，继续既定 service／排空并检查 owner 状态"
msgstr ""
"Retain borrowed storage, continue the defined service/drain path and inspect"
" owner state."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "真正结清、归还及 join 完成"
msgstr "Actual settlement, return and join are complete"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:25
msgid "定位配置字段"
msgstr "Locate a configuration field"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:27
msgid "以自己的 `assembly.toml` 为输入，路径相对当前工作目录："
msgstr ""
"Use your own `assembly.toml`; paths are relative to the current working "
"directory:"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:36
msgid ""
"Native 输入同时加 `--test-support`。结构化拒绝写到标准错误，退出码为 1；命令行 语法错误使用 argparse 诊断和退出码 "
"2。记录中的文件、键、资源、owner、mode 和 source 用来定位作者输入；`explain` 只在有效配置上提供结果，不自动修复拒绝项。"
msgstr ""
"Add `--test-support` for Native inputs. Structured rejection is written to "
"standard error with exit code 1; command-line syntax errors use argparse "
"diagnostics and exit code 2. File, key, resource, owner, mode and source "
"fields identify the author input. `explain` provides results only for valid "
"configurations; it does not automatically repair rejected inputs."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:40
msgid "区分问题的责任"
msgstr "Identify responsibility"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:42
msgid ""
"平台维护者处理公共机制、SoC／provider、配置合同和 SDK 导出。产品处理板级事实、 "
"任务、缓冲、分区、授权与恢复；设备现场处理探针、供电、晶振、接线和观测。 Native 模型不接主机串口，软件 Board 的硅片路线也不代替实际 "
"PCB 连通性。"
msgstr ""
"Platform maintainers own public mechanisms, SoC/providers, configuration "
"contracts and SDK export. Products own Board facts, tasks, buffers, "
"partitions, authorization and recovery. Device operations own probes, power,"
" oscillators, wiring and observations. Native models do not connect to host "
"serial ports, and software Board silicon routes do not establish actual PCB "
"continuity."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/troubleshooting.md:46
msgid ""
"提交问题时附精确源码或 SDK 提交、Board／part／backend、最小 TOML、实际命令、 错误和相关产物身份。移除凭据与私有 PCB "
"数据；不要用另一份 SDK 的成功结果替代 当前失败。所有权细节见[I/O 执行](io-execution.md)，物理检查见 [性能与 "
"HIL](performance-hil.md)。"
msgstr ""
"When reporting an issue, include the exact source or SDK commit, "
"Board/part/backend, minimal TOML, actual command, error and relevant "
"artifact identities. Remove credentials and private PCB data. Do not "
"substitute success from another SDK for the current failure. See [I/O "
"execution](io-execution.md) for ownership and [performance and "
"HIL](performance-hil.md) for physical checks."
